<view class="page pair-page">
  <view class="card steps-card">
    <view class="section-title">绑定你的码卡龙桌面端</view>
    <view class="hint">小程序通过第三方接入协议连接你的 GUI，和你自己的 ESP32 设备走同一套协议。</view>

    <view class="step">
      <view class="step-index">1</view>
      <view class="step-body">
        <view class="step-title">在桌面端生成配对码</view>
        <view class="hint">码卡龙桌面端 → 设置 → 消息接入 → 第三方接入 → 硬件配置 → 生成配对码</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="step">
      <view class="step-index">2</view>
      <view class="step-body">
        <view class="step-title">在此输入 6 位数字</view>
        <view class="hint">配对码 30 分钟内有效，且只能使用一次。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="step">
      <view class="step-index">3</view>
      <view class="step-body">
        <view class="step-title">开始对话</view>
        <view class="hint">绑定成功后即可远程收发消息。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card code-card">
    <block wx:if="{{binding}}">
      <view class="bound-row">
        <view>
          <view class="bound-title">已绑定</view>
          <view class="hint">{{binding.clientId}}</view>
        </view>
        <text class="text-link" bindtap="unbind">解绑</text>
      </view>
      <view class="hint bound-hint">重新绑定会覆盖当前令牌，旧令牌立即失效。</view>
    </block>

    <view class="code-input-wrap">
      <input
        class="code-input"
        type="number"
        maxlength="6"
        placeholder="000000"
        placeholder-class="code-placeholder"
        value="{{pairCode}}"
        bindinput="onPairCodeInput"
        adjust-position="{{true}}"
      />
    </view>

    <button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{bindingInProgress || pairCode.length !== 6}}" bindtap="bind">
      {{bindingInProgress ? '绑定中…' : '立即绑定'}}
    </button>

    <block wx:if="{{error}}">
      <view class="error-bar">{{error}}</view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="card hub-card">
    <view class="kv">
      <view class="kv-label">当前 Hub</view>
      <view class="kv-value">{{hubUrl}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="kv">
      <view class="kv-label">本设备 ID</view>
      <view class="kv-value">{{clientId}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="kv">
      <view class="kv-label">账号</view>
      <view class="kv-value">{{accountLabel}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint requirement">
      注意：桌面端必须已连接 Hub（多机模式），配对码由 Hub 下发并通过 Hub 中继消息；仅监听 127.0.0.1 的本机网关无法被手机访问。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
